<Page title="About Crisp & Cook" description="Who we are and why we make fast air fryer and rice cooker recipes.">
  <p>Hi, and welcome to <strong>{SITE.name}</strong>! We're a small home-kitchen team who love food that's fast, cheap, and actually tasty.</p>
  <p>Most weeknights, nobody has an hour to cook. So we focus on the two appliances that do the heavy lifting: the <strong>air fryer</strong> and the <strong>rice cooker</strong>. Every recipe here comes with exact temperatures, cook times, smart ingredient swaps, and honest tips on what can go wrong.</p>
  <h2>What you'll find here</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Air fryer dinners, snacks, and sides</li>
    <li>Rice cooker one-pot meals</li>
    <li>15-minute dinners for students and busy professionals</li>
    <li>5-ingredient budget meals</li>
  </ul>
